LUMA SUMMARY:
Another QS 5.4 handshake-state test. This time the handshake message remains visible in GPT's UI. Cozmo also identifies a future clean-shutdown feature: QS should someday send a closing message to all active nodes, wait for receipt, and only then terminate.</summary>
